{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'<u><i>Reincarnation Dungeon</i></u>' is a fantasy themed action role-playing game that brings you an unparalleled gaming experience. You will play as an adventurer who travels to another world to find a way back home. Countless enemies are waiting for you to eliminate, and rich spoils of war are waiting for you to obtain. Experience vivid and interesting stories, fight against powerful enemies, and embark on a dangerous and amazing adventure in another world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously explore powerful loot to make oneself stronger.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Skill Tree</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Rich and diverse skills provide players with more fun in receiving goods during battles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to get started</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Committed to creating games that can be easily played by both new and old players, experiencing the joy of constant updates.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpaid Enhancement Content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 '<i><u>Reincarnation Dungeon</u></i>' will not gain game advantages by purchasing in-game items.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837930?t=1758624868","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837930/1b0880114ea5f67efa3baaa21723492d9ad3c77b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758624868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837930/e5feb101619ac8749b677bb4a972b419e1fe013a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758624868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837930/e5feb101619ac8749b677bb4a972b419e1fe013a/caps